<title>UK: FORECAST-Strong growth expected to slice UK PSBR.</title>
<headline>FORECAST-Strong growth expected to slice UK PSBR.</headline>
<byline>Karen Iley</byline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-04-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>Britain appears poised to borrow less under a likely Labour government, with strong growth easing its public sector borrowing requirement (PSBR) throughout 1997 and 1998, a Reuters survey showed on Monday.</p>
<p>From a survey of 32 economists and research institutions between April 7 and 9, 26 gave numbers for PSBR.</p>
